~ start
do start_talking()
do disable_movement()
NPCBlacksmith: [[Hi|Hello|Howdy]], this is [wave]some[/wave] [wait=1]dialogue.
Player: Wow, that's cool!
Player: I can also talk [speed=2]super fast.
NPCBlacksmith: Here are some [speed=0.5]choices.
- First one
	NPCBlacksmith: You picked the first one.
- Second one
	NPCBlacksmith: You picked the second one.
- Start again => start
- End the conversation => END
Nathan: For more information see the online documentation.
do stop_talking()
do enable_movement()
=> END